riptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-10T03:47:13Z","updated_at":"2024-12-10T03:47:13Z","body":"csg brush is crashing which needs debugging but the doc change seems ok to do","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2530196922/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2532232051","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99911#issuecomment-2532232051","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99911","id":2532232051,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6W7stz","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-10T16:34:01Z","updated_at":"2024-12-12T19:34:24Z","body":"> When enabled, it has the same appearance in the editor and running project. I'm guessing this may occur because when **Use Vertex Color** is disabled, the shape is still drawn in white but is drawn _behind_ the debug gizmos.\r\n\r\nThat half transparent blue hue face color is editor specific to not have just plain white solid shapes in the editor. It swaps that color on the mesh in the ` CSGShape2D::draw_shape()` function based on the editor hint and the use vertex color being enabled. Same with the outline or inner polygon edge line debug that is not added at runtime.\r\n\r\n> When Use Vertex Color is disabled, the Vertex Color property should be hidden in the inspector.\r\n\r\nDone.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2532232051/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2533330032","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99911#issuecomment-2533330032","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99911","id":2533330032,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6W_4xw","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-11T00:19:14Z","updated_at":"2024-12-11T00:26:06Z","body":"Fixed a few things and added some additional debug visuals.\r\nIt was getting confusing with more CSG brushes involved what brush does what.\r\n\r\n There is now the option to display the CSG brush outline as debug colored by the operation type.\r\n- OPERATION_UNION -> Green\r\n- OPERATION_INTERSECTION -> Orange\r\n- OPERATION_SUBTRACTION -> Red\r\n\r\nThis option can be enabled per CSG node individually with the `debug_show_brush` property.\r\nBy default this debug is off to not clutter the editor view so much.\r\n\r\n![brush_debug](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/04d008ea-f8a4-495b-a88d-59371aca467d)\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2533330032/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2533354945","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99911#issuecomment-2533354945","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99911","id":2533354945,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6W_-3B","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred